# CivicSaathi AI - Frontend Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to frontend/.env or frontend/.env.local

# Google Maps JavaScript API Key
# 1. Obtain an API key from Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API, and Geocoding API
# 3. Add HTTP referrer restrictions (e.g., http://localhost:5173/*, https://yourdomain.com/*)
# 4. Paste your key below:
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
